OL,3,AMushroom murderer Erin Patterson
OL,4,Alaunches last-ditch High Court appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralia's mushroom killer Erin
OL,7,FPatterson has launched a final legal
OL,8,Fbid to overturn her murder convictions
OL,9,Fand avoid dying in jail.
OL,11,FErin Patterson, 52, was last year found
OL,12,Fguilty of murdering three relatives and
OL,13,Fattempting to kill another when she
OL,14,Fserved them a toxic mushroom-laced meal
OL,15,Fin 2023.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
