OL,3,AMushroom murderer Erin Patterson
OL,4,Alaunches last-ditch High Court appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, in Victoria's Court of
OL,7,FAppeal three judges dismissed an appeal
OL,8,Fagainst her convictions and threw out
OL,9,Fthe possibility she could be released
OL,10,Fon parole ` saying her crimes were
OL,11,F"extraordinarily cold and calculated"
OL,12,Fand had to be "denounced in the
OL,13,Fstrongest terms".
OL,15,FShe has now made a last-ditch
OL,16,Fapplication to the High Court to look
OL,17,Fat her case.
